  "title": "Sedge stitch throw",
  "subtitle": "Groups of three stitches at different heights make a tweedy surface.",
  "excerpt": "Sedge stitch groups a htr, tr, and dtr into the same stitch, making an angled fan cluster that tiles across the row. The result is a dense, tweedy surface on an aran throw.",
